  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MUDA Africa - Core support to Strategic Plan 2017-2020</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core support to Muda Africa`s Strategic Plan 2017-2020.
Impact: Muda Africa contributes to the growth of the creative industries in Tanzania.
Outcomes: 
The performing arts are driven into the formal economy. 
Acceptance of women as professional dance practicioners. 
Audience attitues change positively towards contemporary dance. 
Muda Africa is the key professional learning centre for dance practitioners in Tanzania.</narrative>
  </description>
